OL,3,AHow Bristol shaped Maya Jama before her
OL,4,ATV fame
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaya Jama has gone from Bristol
OL,7,Fschoolgirl to one of the UK's biggest
OL,8,Ftelevision stars.
OL,10,FThe 32-year-old Love Island host is set
OL,11,Fto be watched by millions as she faces
OL,12,Fthe last round table in the final of
OL,13,FThe Celebrity Traitors, due to be aired
OL,14,Fon BBC One at 08:00 GMT tonight.
OL,16,FBut behind the glamorous television
OL,17,Fappearances and red carpet moments is a
OL,18,Fstory that began in a council house
OL,19,Fwith a young girl determined to make it
OL,20,Fon the small screen.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
