OL,3,AHow Bristol shaped Maya Jama before her
OL,4,ATV fame
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaya was born and raised in Bristol,
OL,7,Fgrowing up in St Paul's with a family
OL,8,Fof Bristol Rovers supporters, putting
OL,9,Fon song and dance performances for them
OL,10,Fand charging 20p a time.
